This PR updates a few dependencies in `package.json`:
* `@vue/eslint-config-airbnb` was duplicated in both the `dependencies` and `devDependencies` sections and I removed it from `dependencies`;
* `eslint-config-airbnb-base` and `vite-plugin-eslint` have been moved from `dependencies` to `devDependencies`, since they are not needed in production;
* `0g` has been removed (it seems to be a [game framework for TypeScript](https://www.npmjs.com/package/0g) and got included in #167, but it doesn't seem to be used anywhere and the code seems to work without it too.

These changes should further reduce the size of the bundle sent to the browser, making loading faster.

